<p class="tme-gcb" data-tme-gcb hidden>🎁 <b>Holiday bonus:</b> buy $50 in gift cards and we’ll send you a <b>$5 bonus card</b> for every $50 ($10 for $100)! Bonus cards arrive by email on Jan 1 and are good through Jan 31.</p>
<script>(() => { const n = new Date(new Date().toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'America/New_York' })); const on = n >= new Date(2026, 10, 24) && n <= new Date(2026, 11, 24, 23, 59, 59);
